      "jcr:created": "Tue Jun 02 2026 18:13:58 GMT+0000",
      "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
      "text": "<p><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"fontsize-2-5em\">Intentional <span class=\"futura-bold\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">design.</span></span></span><br>\n</span> <span class=\"fontsize-1-75em\">Implants driven by a total understanding of the arthritic ankle</span></span></p>\n",
