          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<h3><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span class=\"fontsize-1-5em\">Contact Us!</span></span></h3>\n<h4>Send us a message to learn more about&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #ffffff;\"><span style=\"color: #ffb500;\">Incompass<sup>™</sup><span style=\"color: #000000;\">&nbsp;Total Ankle System</span></span></span></h4>\n",
